	<TextRow
		Label="DATACONV_LISTINFO_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>シッポウシティの　はくぶつかんで
ホネの　スペシャリスト　アロエの▽
はなしを　きこう▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-09T02:34:08" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nagihashi_toru:W00268"
				Time="2011-06-24T01:37:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>シッポウシティの　博物館で
ホネの　スペシャリスト　アロエの▽
話を　きこう▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-09T02:34:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
